[17.120000,"o","Dead reckoning estimates position from a known starting point.\nIt uses heading, speed, and elapsed time to project movement.\nEach new estimate depends on the previous calculated position.\nSmall measurement errors accumulate as the path is extended.\nExternal fixes are used periodically to correct the drift.\n"]
